      "description": "Ask about and describe experiences with ever and never.",
      "objective": "Ask about and describe experiences with ever and never.",
      "content": "Use Have/Has ... ever...? to ask if an experience happened at any time in a person's life. Use never for an experience that has not happened.",
      "examples": [
        "Have you ever ridden a horse?",
        "I have never flown in a plane."
      ],
      "commonErrors": [
